{"source": "flora-gabon", "source_id": "fdgvol44_final.xml", "taxon": "Cyperus surinamensis Rottb.", "organ": "inflorescences", "language": "fr", "text": "Inflorescence en anthèle lâche de 5-20 × 5-15 cm, avec à la base, un fascicule d’épillets sous-tendu par 3-12 rameaux portant chacun un fascicule d’épillets ou un nouveau groupe de fascicules d’épillets sessiles et pédonculés; principaux rameaux de l’inflorescence longs de 10 cm au plus, glabres ou finement scabres; fascicules d’épillets, ni en épis, ni digités, mais densément regroupés en petites têtes irrégulières; bractées involucrales habituellement 5-10, foliacées, dressées ou étalées, la plus grande longue de 5-30 cm, dépassant longuement l’inflorescence.", "assertions": [{"po_id": "PO_0009049", "pato_id": "PATO_0001802", "po_label": "inflorescence", "pato_label": "loose", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "anthèle lâche"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009049", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "inflorescence", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 5, "value_high": 20, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "de 5-20 × 5-15 cm"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009049", "pato_id": "PATO_0000921", "po_label": "inflorescence", "pato_label": "width", "negated": false, "value_low": 5, "value_high": 15, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "de 5-20 × 5-15 cm"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009081", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "inflorescence branch", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": 10, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "principaux rameaux de l’inflorescence longs de 10 cm au plus"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009045", "pato_id": "PATO_0000070", "po_label": "involucral bract", "pato_label": "count", "negated": false, "value_low": 5, "value_high": 10, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "usually", "source_text": "bractées involucrales habituellement 5-10"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009045", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "involucral bract", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 5, "value_high": 30, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "la plus grande longue de 5-30 cm"}]}
